# Nordic-Walker: brisk retiree in a lime functional jacket (y/g/G) over
# Lederhosen (O/l), blue cap (S/b) with a long visor, grey hair (i/m),
# white knee socks, grey trail shoes. Prop: two walking poles (m shaft,
# l grip, k outline); the front pole is planted ahead of him and is the
# readable silhouette. Faces right; mirror = auto.
# walk: 0 = front pole planted, 1 = passing (1 px bob up, poles lifted),
# 2 = other leg forward, pole planted again, 3 = passing.
sprite = nordic_walker
size   = 16x24
origin = 8,24
hitbox = 2,2,12,22
mirror = auto
anim   = walk     frames=4 ticks=8 loop
anim   = squished frames=1
